{"id":"87244068ee975a642a4d85472dae0e9b","note_id":"game-common-sense","at":"2026-11-10T05:58:15.844139+00:00","origin":"manual","body_sha256":"423e9eb2a5dcbd4f7a458ec8c93e4c48944e0a29d2e0949f74ebed5c3c73e572","review_refs":[],"record":{"body":{"schema_version":6,"leading":"","nodes":[{"id":"g-1b29ab0f1fc284c57caa","type":"heading","level":1,"title":"游戏打法常识","space":" ","separator":"\n\n"},{"type":"entry","id":"n-557bd7d75bc2eff08f27","key":"执行前的条件核对","show_key":true,"value":"购买、合成、出售或转移资源前，核对该操作是否会改变后续可用的目标和材料。需要连续完成多个动作时，应先确认每一步的资源和顺序。","separator":"\n\n"},{"id":"g-daeb7ac78331c796bf4a","type":"heading","level":2,"title":"经济与购买","space":" ","separator":"\n\n"},{"id":"g-9586605d633ba43aa90f","type":"entry","key":"拍卖失败不扣能量","show_key":true,"value":"竞拍失败不消耗能量。","separator":"\n\n"},{"id":"rw-simple-game-common-sense","type":"entry","key":"额外资源到账前保留必要支出","show_key":true,"value":"一次刷新可能找到关键牌，也可能只消耗能量。如果下一轮升级后即可使用已备好的牌，先留出升级所需的能量，再判断本轮是否需要刷新。仍缺关键组件时，可用低成本英雄暂时维持阵容。若已经有足以继续运转的组合，继续刷新通常只有在可能改变下一场战斗或补足关键缺口时才值得。","separator":"\n\n"},{"id":"g-1683859c02bc524251d5","type":"heading","level":2,"title":"养成与上阵","space":" ","separator":"\n\n"},{"id":"g-41847a0c30afcc0dd7d9","type":"entry","key":"打算卖出时先合成","show_key":true,"value":"手牌中持有与场上英雄同名的卡牌、且已经决定卖出时，先合成增加效果锦囊进度，再出售英雄。","separator":"\n\n"},{"id":"g-3b739ca62b3791293594","type":"entry","key":"上场后不能直接收回手牌","show_key":true,"value":"上场英雄不能直接变回手牌。觉醒回手是例外，但回手后等级仍保留在该英雄卡牌上，不会因此转给其他英雄。","separator":"\n\n"},{"id":"g-75e45ae988405816da57","type":"heading","level":2,"title":"装备使用","space":" ","separator":"\n\n"},{"id":"g-3f1116eca2772e6245cc","type":"entry","key":"基础装备及时铸造","show_key":true,"value":"基础装备本身没有属性和效果；需要它提供战力时，要先铸造成实际装备。","separator":"\n\n"},{"id":"g-8abf76d41baa0487d183","type":"entry","key":"转交装备不会重新选铸造结果","show_key":true,"value":"把已铸造装备交给另一名英雄，装备仍是原来那件；重新选择需要武装重构等对应手段。","separator":"\n\n"},{"id":"rw-simple-equipment-game-common-sense","type":"entry","key":"过渡装备与终局装备的取舍","value":"基础装备铸造后才能提供属性或效果。若当前阵容只差少量战力就能赢下交手或明显减少扣血，可以先铸造现有英雄用得上的装备。若这次铸造仍难改善交手，且该材料是后续主力所需，则应优先保留其用途。武装重构能够摧毁指定英雄的装备并获得随机基础装备，后续可以重新铸造，但无法保证取得所缺材料。","show_key":true,"separator":"\n\n"},{"id":"g-dd01806ce5f7f84fe0a8","type":"heading","level":2,"title":"站位与针对","space":" ","separator":"\n\n"},{"id":"g-989a9fd9e8757c5a8ee0","type":"entry","key":"近卫荣耀覆盖关键队友","show_key":true,"value":"使用近卫荣耀时，让携带它的前排开局站在能覆盖关键队友的位置，利用其提升友方双抗的效果。","separator":"\n\n"},{"id":"g-123faf1acde873683473","type":"entry","key":"红莲炎甲需要贴住目标","show_key":true,"value":"对手依赖生命恢复或吸血时，让能持续贴住目标的前排携带红莲炎甲；其压回复效果不作用于护盾。","separator":"\n\n"},{"id":"g-bb2688520bf8905f5025","type":"heading","level":2,"title":"常见误区","space":" ","separator":"\n\n"},{"id":"g-4673084b24137787becd","type":"entry","key":"不要把受盾抵挡当成受伤回蓝","show_key":true,"value":"英雄攻击和受击都能获得法力，但伤害被护盾抵挡时，不会获得这次受击法力。","separator":"\n\n"},{"id":"g-7edb29ea258a5da9ba94","type":"entry","key":"觉醒回手不等于等级转移","show_key":true,"value":"觉醒回手保留的是该英雄自身等级；需要将等级转移给其他英雄时，需要另外使用有效的等级转移手段。","separator":"\n\n"}],"supporting_nodes":[],"semantics":{}},"metadata":{"id":"game-common-sense","type":"other","title":"游戏打法常识","path":"knowledge/other/游戏打法常识.json","aliases":[],"entities":[],"related":[],"claim_annotations":[{"id":"g-2665753ab221b208dd98","text_ref":"g-9586605d633ba43aa90f","section":"经济与购买","kind":"conditional_strategy","origin":"document","inference":false,"evidence":[{"type":"document","source":"doc-43e5dddcdc3fba2a1fe7fbf9784309d4cbe586ff232964e52284b194c2974c1c","paragraph_start":2,"paragraph_end":2}],"condition":"","version":null,"display_ref":"g-9586605d633ba43aa90f"},{"id":"g-217a8fb9695b2e8cf4c3","text_ref":"g-41847a0c30afcc0dd7d9","section":"养成与上阵","kind":"conditional_strategy","origin":"document","inference":false,"evidence":[{"type":"document","source":"doc-2508470590ca63aab7164b599a0225c985133d890704883c7bb1853c9e3b1f9b","paragraph_start":5,"paragraph_end":5}],"condition":"","version":null,"display_ref":"g-41847a0c30afcc0dd7d9"},{"id":"g-51360b39cb75f7ee77d4","text_ref":"g-3b739ca62b3791293594","section":"养成与上阵","kind":"conditional_strategy","origin":"document","inference":false,"evidence":[{"type":"document","source":"doc-9baf8134cbe312add21f169a29e047768e02eb03bfa0cc9399b1e49c07484de4","paragraph_start":1,"paragraph_end":1}],"condition":"","version":null,"display_ref":"g-3b739ca62b3791293594"},{"id":"g-840c08056be8664418dc","text_ref":"g-3f1116eca2772e6245cc","section":"装备使用","kind":"conditional_strategy","origin":"document","inference":false,"evidence":[{"type":"document","source":"doc-febe43586b8e1f29f5bacc2e326b5b7290880b3368561920ac6c958254c0952a","paragraph_start":1,"paragraph_end":1}],"condition":"","version":null,"display_ref":"g-3f1116eca2772e6245cc"},{"id":"g-99eb64aa3ce8a2e464bf","text_ref":"g-8abf76d41baa0487d183","section":"装备使用","kind":"conditional_strategy","origin":"document","inference":false,"evidence":[{"type":"document","source":"doc-febe43586b8e1f29f5bacc2e326b5b7290880b3368561920ac6c958254c0952a","paragraph_start":2,"paragraph_end":2}],"condition":"","version":null,"display_ref":"g-8abf76d41baa0487d183"},{"id":"g-caf63c274e55f3bb5b7d","text_ref":"g-989a9fd9e8757c5a8ee0","section":"站位与针对","kind":"conditional_strategy","origin":"document","inference":false,"evidence":[{"type":"document","source":"doc-febe43586b8e1f29f5bacc2e326b5b7290880b3368561920ac6c958254c0952a","paragraph_start":7,"paragraph_end":7}],"condition":"","version":null,"display_ref":"g-989a9fd9e8757c5a8ee0"},{"id":"g-78a11296443c3245e891","text_ref":"g-123faf1acde873683473","section":"站位与针对","kind":"conditional_strategy","origin":"document","inference":false,"evidence":[{"type":"document","source":"doc-febe43586b8e1f29f5bacc2e326b5b7290880b3368561920ac6c958254c0952a","paragraph_start":13,"paragraph_end":13}],"condition":"","version":null,"display_ref":"g-123faf1acde873683473"},{"id":"g-e8da18a6ff49f55b5d47","text_ref":"g-4673084b24137787becd","section":"常见误区","kind":"conditional_strategy","origin":"document","inference":false,"evidence":[{"type":"document","source":"doc-438a80cb1460f2a8660